cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this project in academic or technical work, cite the repository as software. Update the repository URL after publishing your fork."
title: "SJRC AutoReader: automated reading-time client for SJRC 2.9.0"
abstract: >-
  A small interoperability study and client collection for the SJRC reading
  service. It maintains the documented reading heartbeat, reports reading
  positions, and stops at a configurable target. The repository includes a
  single-file web app, an Android WebView wrapper, a native Windows client, and
  bilingual protocol documentation derived from the public API and decompiled
  client excerpts.
authors:
  - name: "SJRC AutoReader contributors"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-19"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - sjrc
  - reading-time
  - interoperability
  - reverse-engineering
  - webview
  - win32
  - no-dependencies
type: software
